Package: com.bokecam.tweak
Name: BokeCam
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: System wide virtual camera (VCam) tweak for jailbroken iOS. Replaces the frames produced by AVCaptureVideoDataOutput and AVCapturePhotoOutput with a still image or a looping video chosen from the photo library, controlled from a floating button injected into every application.
Maintainer: BokeCam Developer <bokecam@example.com>
Author: BokeCam Developer
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 14.0)
Tag: role::hacker
Homepage: https://github.com/bokecam/BokeCam
Installed-Size: 480
